<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-[#f5f5f7] dark:bg-[#000000] border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] transition-colors duration-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-4">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider inline-block">
            Important Investor Notice
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">
            Risk Disclosure Statement
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">
            Please read this disclosure carefully before trading equities, digital assets, leveraged instruments, or automated copy strategies.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#161617] transition-colors duration-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-10 text-sm text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6] leading-relaxed">

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/[0.07] border border-amber-500/20 text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7] space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Capital at Risk</h2>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">
                Investing in financial markets involves substantial risk, including the possible loss of all or part of your invested principal. Never invest funds you cannot afford to lose, and ensure each product aligns with your financial objectives and risk tolerance.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">1. Market &amp; Volatility Risk</h2>
            <p>
                Prices of US equities, ETFs, commodities, foreign exchange, and digital assets fluctuate continuously in response to macroeconomic events, earnings, liquidity shifts, and regulatory developments. Digital assets in particular can experience rapid, double-digit price swings within short periods.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">2. Leverage &amp; Margin Risk</h2>
            <p>
                Trading on margin or with leveraged derivatives magnifies both potential gains and potential losses. Adverse price movements can trigger automatic stop-outs or position liquidation to prevent negative balances.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">3. Copy Trading &amp; Historical Performance</h2>
            <p>
                Historical returns, Sharpe ratios, win rates, and drawdown metrics displayed for copy-trading strategies reflect past performance only and are not reliable indicators of future results. Execution timing and slippage may cause minor differences between a master strategy and follower accounts.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">4. Tax &amp; Retirement Account Considerations</h2>
            <p>
                Tax treatment of investment gains, dividends, and retirement accounts (such as Roth or Traditional IRAs) depends on individual circumstances and applicable tax law, which may change. Mainstreet Capital Exchange does not provide individualized tax, legal, or fiduciary financial advice.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">5. Technology &amp; Network Risk</h2>
            <p>
                Electronic trading and blockchain transfers depend on internet connectivity, third-party price feeds, and underlying settlement networks. Network congestion or outages may delay order submission, quote updates, or crypto confirmations.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
